        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.\r\rHobbyist Journalist Olivia D. Trent has uncovered a sinister plot aboard the yacht. Ritter&apos;s bodyguard, Ronnie Aguilar, is developing a brainwashing texting cyber-virus to launch a  crime empire in Ritter&apos;s place.\r\rHis first test subject is Olivia&apos;s own best friend, Amy M. Lee. To prevent Aguilar from weponizing the virus globally, both Lee and Aguilar must be neutralized immediately.\r\rA tragic neccessity, 47. Eliminate the targets and extract.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
